OL,3,GNEWSATeen golfer hopes to turn pro
OL,4,Aafter junior champs win
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 17-year-old amateur golfer who won
OL,7,Fthe World Junior Girls Golf
OL,8,FChampionship in Canada in October says
OL,9,Fit is a "huge step" in her golfing
OL,10,Fcareer, and she soon hopes to turn
OL,11,Fprofessional.
OL,13,FLauren Crump, from Whitchurch,
OL,14,FShropshire, finished the individual
OL,15,Fcompetition with a 1-under 70 to finish
OL,16,Fthe tournament at 11-under.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
