OL,3,GNEWSATeen golfer hopes to turn pro
OL,4,Aafter junior champs win
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe win means she has earned a place at
OL,7,Fthe 2027 CPKC Women's Open in August
OL,8,F2027 at Gatineau in Canada - it will be
OL,9,Fthe second time she has competed in a
OL,10,FLadies Professional Golf Association
OL,11,F(LGPA) event.
OL,13,F"[The win] definitely gave me a lot of
OL,14,Fconfidence. It's been a championship
OL,15,FI've aspired to win... it was an
OL,16,Fincredible feeling," Crump told the
OL,17,FBBC.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
